  </div>
  <div class="card-grid">
    <div class="info-card"><h3>Polyform Shield</h3><p class="muted">Source-available — use, modify, and build on the source internally; only offering it as a competing product or service is restricted. No license fees or royalties.</p></div>
    <div class="info-card"><h3>Perpetual, closed source</h3><p class="muted">One-time license for ongoing use of the software as delivered — no subscriptions or recurring fees; source is not included.</p></div>
    <div class="info-card"><h3>Open Source (Apache 2.0)</h3><p class="muted">Free to use, modify, and distribute — including in commercial products — with attribution.</p></div>
  </div>
